1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,080
Being a state function, entropy returns to its starting value round any cycle.

2
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:07,799
Check it on the Carnot cycle.

3
00:00:07,799 --> 00:00:12,773
The gas gains Q one over T one, and loses Q two over T two.

4
00:00:12,773 --> 00:00:17,877
Since Q two over Q one equals T two over T one, these are equal.

5
00:00:17,877 --> 00:00:20,065
The net change is zero.

